WEBVTT

00:15:28.316 --> 00:15:32.276
And for me as a social entrepreneur
building my second movement, you know,

00:15:32.276 --> 00:15:33.916
with Marshall Plan for Moms,

00:15:33.956 --> 00:15:36.116
that is a big lesson that I learned.

00:15:36.156 --> 00:15:39.076
Is that you can't keep talking
to the converted.

00:15:39.116 --> 00:15:40.556
We've got to convert.

00:15:41.316 --> 00:15:44.316
[Get access to thought-provoking events
you won't want to miss.]

00:15:44.356 --> 00:15:47.156
[Become a TED Member
at ted.com/membership]